<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sort</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi> command moves crafting materials from your
backpack into your equipped component bag, and potions into
your equipped bandolier.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi>     Move materials and potions into their containers.

You must have a component bag and/or a bandolier equipped.
Materials are items flagged as crafting components (ores, herbs,
leather, binding paste, gemstones, etc.). Potions are any
drinkable items (healing salves, elixirs, tonics, etc.).

When you pick up or buy these items, they automatically go into
the appropriate container if one is equipped and has space.
The <ansi fg="command">sort</ansi> command is for organizing items that were already
in your backpack before you equipped the container.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help inventory</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
